y","owner":"tannewt","html_url":"https://github.com/tannewt/trackball-proximity","stars":5,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Press a keyboard key when your hand is on a trackball","topics":[],"score":289439,"global_rank":27299,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5622},{"name":"zdwolfe/zstat","owner":"zdwolfe","html_url":"https://github.com/zdwolfe/zstat","stars":6,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Bone-simple tool for generating basic numerical stats from stdin","topics":[],"score":289429,"global_rank":27301,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5623},{"name":"lordlosslyy/Semantic-Segmentation-CNN-for-India-Driving-Dataset","owner":"lordlosslyy","html_url":"https://github.com/lordlosslyy/Semantic-Segmentation-CNN-for-India-Driving-Dataset","stars":5,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"We use deep convolutional neural networks to experiment semantic segmentation task on India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":289377,"global_rank":27316,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5624},{"name":"smfxfc/FighterFactBot","owner":"smfxfc","html_url":"https://github.com/smfxfc/FighterFactBot","stars":3,"forks